    "content": "Title: Parent Support | ConceiveAbilities\n\nContent: Parent support: Raising expectations by reducing the unexpected From first consultation to bringing your baby home, our fertility specialists offer the best expertise for all stages in the journey. While some agencies only specialize in particular parts of the surrogacy and egg donation process, only ConceiveAbilities® has the experience and foresight to support you throughout the entire terrain of surrogacy and egg donation. Benefits of our surrogacy and egg donation programs Our proprietary matching program, Matching Matters®, connects you with a surrogate who shares your values and expectations In-depth screening ensures healthy and committed surrogates Match Manager oversees the entire process to mitigate any conflicts or issues before they begin Guidance on insurance and legal matters Best-in-class customized in-house legal team who are leaders in family fertility and surrogacy law Relationships with the world’s leading fertility clinics; our vetting is designed to work with these clinic’s protocols Ready to put the power of a comprehensive surrogacy agency to work to find a surrogate mother? Contact us",
    "source": "https://www.conceiveabilities.com/parents/parents-support/"
